    "detailed_description": "Dive into a realm where the art of subterfuge meets the cutting edge of technology. As the ultimate covert operative, your mission extends beyond mere infiltration \u2013 assassinate high-profile targets, breach impregnable security zones, and liberate priceless treasures from the clutches of the elite.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/24ba52d92d7ca526e3d9d120de0626a3.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=131 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/843b91459341f23c298a4eeb9ce0769a.poster.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/843b91459341f23c298a4eeb9ce0769a.webm?t=1729022749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/843b91459341f23c298a4eeb9ce0769a.mp4?t=1729022749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Command a suite of over 32 augmentations, shaping your body into the epitome of stealth and combat prowess. Grappling hooks, silent footfalls, and combat maneuvers await strategic deployment, each choice defining your destiny.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/10b3267f5f31247ba0424289efb42fb2.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=131 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/554966f37500baaebc53c0a4bebc0406.poster.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/554966f37500baaebc53c0a4bebc0406.webm?t=1729022749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/554966f37500baaebc53c0a4bebc0406.mp4?t=1729022749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Elevate your arsenal with 7 distinctive swords and 8 crossbows, each boasting unique abilities. From explosive parry swords to crossbows seeking out enemies, tailor your loadout for any shadowy challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/bb8ec2f812f1a3413f7f0db9ca060801.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=131 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/a4ff119f41e82dab0aa86121458141b9.poster.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/a4ff119f41e82dab0aa86121458141b9.webm?t=1729022749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/a4ff119f41e82dab0aa86121458141b9.mp4?t=1729022749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Adapt to ever-changing landscapes with an arsenal of diverse bolt types, 8 attuned to your surroundings. Paralyze foes, create distractions, or vanish in a smokescreen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/36817333a7f12017556b2f0434d74487.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=131 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700020/extras/53b0cece18d4321c4b8a1f7732cfa713.poster.avif?t=1729022749\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"ht